physically eighteen, preserving both youth and beauty, but live only until forty-five.  \nCourse II: age naturally, as people always have, and live to around ninety.\n\nSatsuki, the daughter of an actress who became the very symbol of Course I, dreams of becoming an actress herself. Her best friend Riri dreams of becoming an idol.\n\nSomeday, they promise, they’ll each rise to the top of their own world.\n\nBut once they make their Choices, the lives of these two inseparable friends begin to diverge.","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Sci-Fi","Psychological","Philosophical","Drama","Tragedy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/e7aa0e86-8f8e-47a7-9653-14bea99e91f6/179ec7ff-66c4-4d02-971a-8a6aa460aeb3.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","vi"],"lane":"manga","rating":7.56,"follows":480,"listAt":"2026-10-22T19:00:06.835Z","chapters":[{"id":"18bd9ed6-a530-46ec-8788-182e1f242890","number":"1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":41,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T23:40:04+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":1,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-26T19:10:15.450Z"},"85456d9d-9c70-49e4-bbda-462b5a4af3c4":{"id":"85456d9d-9c70-49e4-bbda-462b5a4af3c4","title":"Isshou Hatarakitakunai Ore ga, Classmate no Daininki Idol ni Natsukaretara","altTitle":"A Very Popular Idol Classmate has Taken a Liking to Me, a Person Who doesn't Want to Work for my Whole Life","description":"Rintaro Shido, a high school student who aspires to become a full-time househusband, is in the class with a very popular idol, Rei Otosaki. The two have no connection other than being classmates, but their relationship changes drastically when Rintaro serves Rei a home-cooked meal after she nearly collapses from hunger! The food was so delicious that Rei said, \"Can I come here every day to eat?\"...!?","year":2023,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Romance","Comedy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mang